# Negative-control mutant — a failed list read is reported (R38 item 6; B7)
#
# Scenario it must flip: contract-product.list-rows-and-picker.int.test.ts,
#   "AC-1 when my products cannot be read I am told my list has an error, with
#   the reason the read returned".
# Mutation: `hasError` reads only the criteria error and drops the query's own
#   read error, so a failed read reports no error.
